{"speciesId":635,"names":{"fr":"Trioxhydre","es":"Hydreigon","en":"Hydreigon","ja":"サザンドラ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Un Pokémon violent qui patrouille le ciel avec ses six ailes et se jette sur tout ce qui bouge, pensant voir un ennemi."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"This brutal Pokémon travels the skies on its six wings. Anything that moves seems like a foe to it, triggering its attack."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Les têtes sur ses bras n’ont pas de cerveau. Avec ses trois têtes, il dévore et détruit tout."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The heads on their arms do not have brains. They use all three heads to consume and destroy everything."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It responds to movement by attacking. This scary, three-headed Pokémon devours everything in its path!"},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It responds to movement by attacking. This scary, three-headed Pokémon devours everything in its path!"},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Les têtes sur ses bras n’ont pas de cerveau. Avec ses trois têtes, il dévore et détruit tout."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Las cabezas de sus dos brazos no tienen cerebro. Con sus tres cabezas destruye y devora todo a su paso."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The heads on their arms do not have brains. They use all three heads to consume and destroy everything."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"両腕の 頭は 脳みそを 持たない。 ３つの 頭で すべてを 食べつくし 破壊してしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Un Pokémon effrayant. Ses trois têtes dévorent tout ce qui bouge jusqu’à satiété."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Un Pokémon temible que ataca todo lo que se mueve y devora con sus tres cabezas cuanto halla a su paso."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It responds to movement by attacking. This scary, three-headed Pokémon devours everything in its path!"},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"動く ものに 反応